## Old vs. Tuned Logic

### Original

```spl
index=* EventCode=4624
```

### Tuned

```spl
index=* EventCode=4624 LogonType=3
| where IpAddress!="-" AND IpAddress!="127.0.0.1" AND IpAddress!="::1"
```

Conceptually:

```text
ALL SUCCESSFUL LOGONS
        |
        v
Event ID 4624
        |
        v
Network Logons Only
Logon Type 3
        |
        v
Remove Empty Sources
        |
        v
Remove Loopback Sources
        |
        v
Remote Network Authentication Candidates
```

